I just added another wiki page, a matrix of chips and associated SATA 
hardware features.  The goal is not to exhaustively compare chips, but 
rather to give users information about whether or not their hardware (or 
to-be-purchased hardware) supports certain key features they need.

http://ata.wiki.kernel.org/index.php/SATA_hardware_features

Driver developers, please review...

As always with the wiki, suggestions and additions welcome.  Please only 
add new columns if the features are useful and asked-for -- I don't want 
this page to turn into a hardware vendor penis size war.

	Jeff


